{
  "id": 22,
  "name": "cluster_density_lookahead",
  "intent": "Bias construction toward candidates embedded in dense unvisited neighborhoods by rewarding cluster_density, while penalizing candidates whose nearest unvisited neighbor is far (poor 1-step continuation / dead-end risk). The -distance term preserves dominant local proximity. cluster_density is the primary differentiator from the seed rules (NN, return-aware, regret-aware), enabling cluster-first region traversal. Weights are bounded to avoid overshadowing distance.",
